{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2021-12-08 13:15:00', 'title': 'KRAFT HEINZ ANNOUNCES INTENTION TO COMBINE U.S. AND CANADA BUSINESSES TO FORM THE NORTH AMERICA ZONE', 'text': "PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL COMBINE ITS U.S. AND CANADA BUSINESSES TO CREATE THE NORTH AMERICA ZONE, WHICH IS EXPECTED TO BE EFFECTIVE IN THE SECOND FISCAL QUARTER OF 2022. THE MOVE IS MEANT TO ADVANCE THE GLOBAL FOOD AND BEVERAGE LEADER'S LONG-TERM, SUSTAINABLE GROWTH PLANS—WHICH WERE FIRST OUTLINED AT ITS INVESTOR DAY EVENT IN SEPTEMBER 2020—BY BRINGING INCREASED AGILITY TO ITS INNOV"}